7. Bb2 {[%cal Gb2f6] The bishop takes aim at the kingside along the long diagonal.}
7... Nc6 {Develops and controls d4 and e5. The knight on c6 controls d4 and e5.}
8. e3 {Holds d4 and keeps the option of cxd5 or d4 at the right moment.}
