 7... O-O {Black. Castles kingside: the king is safe and the rook on f8 joins the game.}
 8. e4 {Gains time on the f5-bishop. Claims the centre: the pawn on e4 eyes the pawn on d5 and the bishop on f5. It also opens a line for the queen on e1.}
