[Event "vs 1...f5 (Dutch)"]

{Against the Dutch, White plays d3 and e4 to blow open the e-file and the weakened e8–h5 diagonal.}
1. Nf3 {[%csl Ge5,Gd4] A flexible start. Develops the knight to f3, where it controls e5 and d4.}
